Read this block honestly on stage: the host has a network. Our claim is not that
the laptop is airgapped — it is that (a) the inspection path never uses the network,
and (b) the agent runtime is denied egress at the proxy, outside its own control.
The machine-checkable version of (b) is evidence/rule02-providers.txt.

